(text "USB host controls the sweep. Pico implements output sequencing, fault handling, and watchdog.\n19 points: 0.30-1.20V / 0.05V steps. Scale changes perform a controlled power-cycle.\nJ401 exposes only the debug bus; it does not replace the Pico safety state machine.\nAUX5V keeps control power independent of the PC connection." (at 25 196 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left top) ) (uuid "f8d1be2c-4675-5c4d-8b59-0a61aed5e270"))
(text "No VIN/current telemetry: shared HW_FAULT_N indicates U509 input-low or another hardware fault." (at 150 268 0) (effects (font (size 0.95 0.95)) (justify left top) ) (uuid "c4a1e67c-b75d-56d0-974e-9642500afb2f"))
