(text "ON performs configuration and a single RUN_SET pulse.\nOFF and faults clear the run latch; recovery needs a new ON.\nGP10 output: RUN_SET. GP5 input: RUN_LATCH.\nNo manual ARM control or dedicated ARM indicators." (at 160 147 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left top) ) (uuid "c7cbe1f8-bdfd-5f64-884f-6dc15303a7ec")))
